<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You prepare a rich table here before me with grace</l><l>In presence of foes that I must face.</l><l>You ’noint me with oil—how my cup overflows!</l><l>Fore’er in Your house, my repose.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>You are my one true Friend who always walks by my side;</l><l>In every trial, I in You confide;</l><l>With peace You console me when no one is near;</l><l>Your gentle voice quells all my fear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>You are my Love, Belovéd—You’re so sweet and divine,</l><l>In Your embrace, all my heart is Thine.</l><l>Your kisses revive me in my deepest part—</l><l>You’ve captured and wooed all my heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
